### Introduction

This project aim to observe the flood intersection with buildings within 3 suburbs within auckland layer: Mt Roskill, Mt Albert, and Sandringham. It answers questions on how many exposed buildings within auckland suburbs are there and which of these buildings are criticals


### Instructions

- Make sure you have Python3.14+
- Run `python -m pip install -r requirements.txt`
- Run the code in `exposure.py`